   "support": [
    {
     "source": "s5",
     "quote": "The Pareto principle (also known as the 80:20 rule, the law of the vital few and the principle of factor sparsity) states that, for many outcomes, roughly 80% of consequences come from 20% of causes (the \"vital few\").",
